          "dense_rank": 1,
          "lexical_score": 19.607353,
          "lexical_rank": 1,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## While you wait\n\nFree guest Wi-Fi is available in the waiting area: the network is called VisitDoc-Guest, and the password is printed on the card at the front desk. Please set your phone to silent and take calls outside. Photography and video recording are not allowed in the waiting area, to protect other patients' privacy.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.31020564,
          "dense_rank": 2,
          "lexical_score": 4.128022,
          "lexical_rank": 6,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n\nThis guide lists, plan by plan, the health insurance plans we are in-network with. Insurance companies sell many plans under one brand name, and being in-network with a company does not mean being in-network with every plan it sells. Check the plan name printed on the front of your insurance card - it usually appears next to the company logo or under \"Plan\" - and compare it with the lists below.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.27875638,
          "dense_rank": 3,
          "lexical_score": 4.1748996,
          "lexical_rank": 5,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## Aetna\n\nWe are in-network with Aetna Choice POS II and Aetna Open Access Managed Choice. Aetna Medicare Advantage PPO plans are in-network as well. Plans administered by Aetna Signature Administrators use a separate network, and we are not part of it.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.2680355,
          "dense_rank": 4,
          "lexical_score": 4.292705,
          "lexical_rank": 3,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## Cigna\n\nWe are in-network with Cigna Open Access Plus (OAP) and Cigna PPO plans. Cigna LocalPlus plans are in-network only for members who live in our county; the network area is printed on the back of the card. Cigna Connect plans bought through the health insurance marketplace are not in-network.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.24684955,
          "dense_rank": 5,
          "lexical_score": 4.082186,
          "lexical_rank": 7,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## Blue Cross Blue Shield\n\nWe are in-network with Blue Cross Blue Shield PPO plans, including BlueCard PPO members whose plan was issued in another state; look for the suitcase logo with the letters \"PPO\" on your card. The Federal Employee Program (FEP) Basic Option and Standard Option plans are in-network too. We are not in-network with Blue Essentials HMO or Blue Advantage HMO plans, because those plans only cover care from their own medical groups.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.2305754,
          "dense_rank": 6,
          "lexical_score": 4.3202195,
          "lexical_rank": 2,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## UnitedHealthcare\n\nWe are in-network with UnitedHealthcare Choice Plus and UnitedHealthcare Options PPO. UnitedHealthcare Navigate HMO is not in-network. AARP Medicare Advantage plans from UnitedHealthcare are in-network when the plan is a PPO, and not in-network when it is an HMO.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 34,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.21216461,
          "dense_rank": 7,
          "lexical_score": 4.2616363,
          "lexical_rank": 4,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Phone calls\n\nIf we cannot reach you by phone, we leave a voicemail with only the clinic's name, a callback number and your first name - never th",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 30,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.19437236,
          "dense_rank": 8,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Dental care guide\n## Feeling anxious about the dentist\n\nLet us know when you book or when you check in. The dentist will agree a stop signal with you - raising your left hand - and will pause whenev",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 38,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.19338417,
          "dense_rank": 9,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Procedure codes and self-pay prices\n## A code you do not recognise\n\nIf your receipt shows a code that is not in this list, the front desk can tell you what it is.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.19142263,
          "dense_rank": 10,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Bringing someone with you\n\nYou may bring one adult companion into the consulting room. Anyone else who comes with you can wait in the waiting area.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 33,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.1906083,
          "dense_rank": 11,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## Checking in on time\n\nCheck in at the front desk or at the self-check-in kiosk as soon as you arrive. Your arrival is recorded when you check in, not when you enter the building.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.18366814,
          "dense_rank": 12,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## The self-check-in kiosk\n\nReturning patients can check in at the kiosk beside the front desk instead of queuing. Scan the QR code from your 48-hour reminder text, or ty",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 32,
