          "similarity_score": 0.18357748,
          "dense_rank": 13,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Vaccinations\n## COVID-19 vaccine\n\nWe offer the updated COVID-19 vaccine for the current season made by Pfizer-BioNTech (Comirnaty). We do not stock the Moderna (Spikevax) or Novavax vaccines.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 34,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.17706516,
          "dense_rank": 14,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Email\n\nWe use email only to confirm a new appointment and to send an itemized receipt you have asked for. We do not send test results or medical",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 36,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.17575797,
          "dense_rank": 15,
          "lexical_score": 3.5774233,
          "lexical_rank": 8,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Conversations with the chat assistant\n\nConversations with the clinic's chat assistant are kept with your appointment records. Clinic staff can read them, ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 36,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.17462415,
          "dense_rank": 16,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Questions and complaints about privacy\n\nOur privacy officer answers questions about how your information is used and handles privacy complaints. Ask the f",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 23,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.17343608,
          "dense_rank": 17,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Which health insurance plans do you accept?\nAnswer: We accept most major insurance providers, including Blue Cross Blue Shield, Aetna, Cigna, UnitedHealthcare, and Medicare. If you're unsure",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 34,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.17167144,
          "dense_rank": 18,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Text message reminders\n\nWe send a reminder by text message 48 hours before your appointment and another 2 hours before it. Our messages always c",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 34,
          "chunk_index": 3,
